{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving \u2014 new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3012260?t=1756324652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3012260?t=1756324652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756324652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756324652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3026400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a classic racing game with realistic physics and futuristic cars.<br>You can take part in racing event somewhere on the Earth in optimistic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cars, 3 tracks, career mode to unlock them all. PvE, PvP, split screen and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Race: Select a track, a car and drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career: Unlock new cars and tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Just run with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split screen local PvP (Select player 2 in &quot;Quick Race&quot; mode).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a complex car physics including tire, wheel, suspension dynamics, aerodynamics: (front, rear wings and body contributions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZukuRace is a gamepad-oriented racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires precise trigger presses (e.g. trail braking technique) and analog stick movement. It was developed and tested with XBox gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with keyboard as well (not the best experience).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel is not supported yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any bugs are encountered, please report them on the Discord server. No personal data is collected, so if something goes wrong, a report would be appreciated. Help me to make an awesome game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly evolving \u2014 new features will be added as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you find this game interesting. Welcome here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Zukurace team"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012260/8fac110c699468e9c824dd28309d43e990c53057/header.jpg?t=1756324652","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3012260/156886467/6a69887ffd4f691aec35791266edbb155ea2737f/1753788829/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753793585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.